{"id":1056,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为提升青年教师的学术素养和科研能力，马克思主义学院于2023年10月20日在学院701会议室举行了青年项目（国社、教育部）论证会。本次会议由马克思主义学院院长赵笑蕾主持，特别邀请山西省委党校潘峰教授莅临指导。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AMmQ1RLm98Uz98LmmV7oRGDUzLiU8-NDnNVVnRA7MNLao7l0gihFp2hmCIa0USysokhRUYyaL4-4LmARLm-DLmfRL7WfLlUPLRnRMz7PUNVFnRNsLll4LNQFLzWVM77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR-8g4LboRUJqdTnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A78CC032328C22620C0BA1D104C511BA/D971E32F/12E4A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Anml1sL4rfUlW2Um46kU46RL77anRQNfnz-aMlVknNWVnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8U1yDnShRM7Qfnl74MmCYn7MfM8MVL4r7LzlsM7QkU4MFUzU4MzrfnzMFLzLDo7nkgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGYMky4oz98gtA8pUTcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次青年项目（国社、教育部）论证会主要围绕新时代党的全面领导制度执行机制研究、马克思现代性思想及其当代价值研究、红色文化育人的机理与路径研究、新时代中国特色乡村振兴战略理论与实践研究、新时代兵工精神的内涵与实践研究等议题进行了热烈的研讨和深度的交流。潘峰教授强调，青年教师要选定一个研究方向深耕下去，一辈子只做一件小事，将一件小事做到极致，方可取得成功。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AUmW1fMzU8MzUDUmm-8M7l8L7CbU8QNVMN-DL4TRMNCDL4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRLYh2UYyYolrfM8r2U8rVoRrfUNMRUNUioRGaM8CZnz6FM7VVnzGaozAFLzrVM7CJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR-8g4LboRUJqdTnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7C3FC29EA7EFCEE85ABCCBD58007F8E7/4AEE0098/15E4F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Aoz71YLl7DMzffLmmlZUzfkoRG4MlLNiolQVLlUao7C4oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8okyYUSyaUllaUmfVU4rfnmGsozGDLlUbo7MkUmNZozAFoz9sM47aL8nFLlMVMNW2gtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGYMky4oz98gtA8pUTcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AM8-1Yol7PL46fUmzUZLRLDoR9DLRlNDnzvYLlM7M4T2Mzv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPUYh7USysLlnVLzCZL7CZL4LYMmAfozQRMNnfLRCPL7WFolCYnmn7LNrFLzlPLN7Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR-8g4LboRUJqdTnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D1CDA71DE1680F833268A96C6DA0610B/9F2F4D2E/1512A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AU4A17UmL8UNLPUmNMfU874n77iM87NDozGZU8CsU4rVM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yYMYhVn1yso77snmvPLmvDLRV2LN-YMzfRUmlYUmrkMlQFL8LDozNiMzMFLlUDUzlZgtXaQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGYMky4oz98gtA8pUTcc&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次青年项目（国社、教育部）论证会有深度、有高度、有广度，这对于青年教师提升马克思主义理论学科学术素养起到了积极的推动作用。<br /></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AMmQ1RLm98Uz98LmmV7oRGDUzLiU8-NDnNVVnRA7MNLao7l0gihFp2hmCIa0USysokhRUYyaL4-4LmARLm-DLmfRL7WfLlUPLRnRMz7PUNVFnRNsLll4LNQFLzWVM77Jqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLR-8g4LboRUJqdTnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1024&nid=3984&e=.jpg"}